# Vue 3 + TypeScript

{{#if parameters.compositionApi}}
- Use Composition API with `<script setup lang="ts">`
- Extract reusable logic into composables in `composables/`
{{/if}}
- Define props with `defineProps<T>()` and emits with `defineEmits<T>()`
{{#if parameters.usePinia}}
- Use Pinia stores for shared state
{{/if}}
- Keep components focused; split large SFCs into smaller ones
